# Comparison of Hyperledger Fabric and Ethereum Blockchain

**Authors:** Zishan Zhao

## Abstract
Blockchain technology has received wide attention from researchers and scientists. Blockchain technology is also upgrading all the time. When the original Bitcoin was created, it laid the groundwork for the emergence of Ethereum. Now new federation chains like Hyperledger Fabric are growing fast. Ethereum and fabric are the two representatives. Permissioned and private blockchain platforms are increasingly used in today’s industry. Different blockchain implementations use different consensus protocols. This article briefly compares Hyperledger Fabric and Ethereum from several aspects such as consensus and smart contacts.

